(LUM-MSA-HARBOR-2026-V1  ·  Article 1 Definitions · Article 2 Services) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Article 1 ? Definitions) Tj
T*
("Platform" means Provider's hosted document workflow and electronic signature software,) Tj
T*
(including APIs.) Tj
T*
("Customer Data" means documents, signature fields, audit events, and metadata submitted to the) Tj
T*
(Platform by or on behalf of Customer.) Tj
T*
("Envelope" means a signature request tracked by an envelope id such as ENV-MSA-7F2C91.) Tj
T*
("Countersign" means the second \(or later\) signature in an ordered signing ceremony, applied) Tj
T*
(after a prior signer has completed.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Article 2 ? Services) Tj
T*
(Provider shall provide the Platform in a professional and workmanlike manner. Customer's SKUs,) Tj
T*
(user band, and environments are set out on the Order Form attached as Exhibit A. Sandbox tenants) Tj
T*
(are for testing only and do not carry production uptime credits.) Tj
