(Article 3 ? Fees and Payment) Tj
T*
(Fees are as set forth on the Order Form. Invoices are due net thirty \(30\) days. Late amounts) Tj
T*
(accrue interest at one percent \(1%\) per month or the maximum permitted by law, whichever is) Tj
T*
(less.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Article 4 ? Term and Termination) Tj
T*
(4.1 Initial Term. The initial term of this Agreement is twelve \(12\) months beginning on the) Tj
T*
(Effective Date.) Tj
T*
(4.2 Renewal. This Agreement does not auto-renew. Any extension requires a signed amendment or a) Tj
T*
(new Order Form.) Tj
T*
(4.3 Termination for Convenience. After the Initial Term, either Party may terminate for) Tj
T*
(convenience by giving the other Party thirty \(30\) days prior written notice.) Tj
T*
(4.4 Termination for Cause. Either Party may terminate if the other Party materially breaches and) Tj
T*
(fails to cure within thirty \(30\) days after written notice.) Tj
T*
() Tj
